# frame-src also applies when a frame navigates itself, which the sandbox on the
# Pastebin embed cannot stop. Every source a frame loads from must be listed:
#   'self'                   Cloudflare needs /cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/ allowed
#   pastebin.com             server detail embed; the path keeps it on the embed
#   app.mine.talk            support widget; moves between its own paths
#   www.googletagmanager.com Google tag service worker frame, enabled remotely
# Cloudflare Turnstile would need https://challenges.cloudflare.com added here.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-src 'self' https://pastebin.com/embed_iframe/ https://app.mine.talk https://www.googletagmanager.com/static/service_worker/
